<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>__HANDLE__</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>specifies the SPI Handle. This parameter can be SPI where x: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 or 6 to select the SPI peripheral. </para>
</parameterdescription>
